docs/zed.md linguist-generated=true

# Schema/validation-file fixtures are parsed byte-for-byte (schema DSL error
# messages report line/column position), and several tests compare their
# contents against hardcoded LF string literals. Without this, Windows
# checkouts with core.autocrlf=true would convert them to CRLF and break
# both the comparisons and the reported positions.
#
# *.zed is covered repo-wide since the extension is unique to this DSL. YAML
# fixtures are scoped by directory instead, since *.yaml/*.yml would
# otherwise also match unrelated CI/config files (workflows, dependabot,
# goreleaser, etc.) that have no reason to be forced to LF.
*.zed text eol=lf
internal/cmd/validate-test/**/*.yaml text eol=lf
internal/cmd/import-test/*.yaml text eol=lf
internal/schemaexamples/schemas/**/*.yaml text eol=lf